From f5a4c8bc93e63bf5642723228f058f0a9927576c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:43:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] minimax_m3: paged KV pool, page-reference snapshots and
 per-rank memory budget (host only)

pool.zig: per-rank page geometry from config + shard (76,800 B/token, 128-token
pages = selection blocks, K/V/IK head-major per layer), kv_pool Layout, and the
int32 block tables (page ids, -1 padded) the attention kernels take.
state.zig: stream state and prompt cache as page references in the radix store
(no recurrent state), admit/keep/end.
budget.zig: weights + runtime + workspaces + host reserve, largest fitting
context and pool, refusal text for a CONTEXT that cannot fit.
test-minimax-pool build step and tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
